sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant App as Sender App
    participant API as services/api
    participant S3 as S3 Encrypted Bucket
    participant Recipient as Recipient App

    App->>App: Generate Random K_media & AES-GCM Encrypt File
    App->>API: POST /api/v1/attachments/upload-url
    API-->>App: Short-lived Presigned PUT URL
    App->>S3: Upload Encrypted Ciphertext Blob
    App->>Recipient: Send E2EE Message containing (objectKey, K_media, IV)
    Recipient->>API: Request Download Presigned GET URL
    Recipient->>S3: Fetch Ciphertext Blob
    Recipient->>Recipient: Decrypt File locally using K_media
